# ==============================================================================
# Childcare Support PWA — Staging Environment Configuration Template (.env.staging)
# ==============================================================================
#
# PURPOSE:
# Template for isolated staging deployment on Render / serverless runtime.
# This file defines all server-side environment variables consumed by the application,
# their consumers, expected formats, isolation guards, and masked dummy values.
#
# ISOLATION GUARDS:
# 1. APP_ENV and NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_ENV MUST be 'staging'.
# 2. APPS_SCRIPT_URL must point to a dedicated staging Apps Script Web App.
#    The runtime guard (validateUpstreamEndpoint) will reject operational deployment IDs.
# 3. WEBHOOK_SECRET is sent strictly in HTTPS JSON request bodies (payload.secret).
#    Never supply secrets via URL query parameters.
# 4. Zero real secrets or operational beneficiary credentials may be placed in this file.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Core Application Environment
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Consumed by: Next.js runtime, sessionService, canonicalSubmissionAdapter
# Allowed values: production | staging | development | test
NODE_ENV=production

# Consumed by: canonicalSubmissionAdapter (validateUpstreamEndpoint, getAppEnvironment)
# Allowed values: staging
APP_ENV=staging

# Consumed by: Client-side environment indicators, telemetry tags
# Allowed values: staging
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_ENV=staging

# Consumed by: Render / Node server listener
# Default: 3000
PORT=3000

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Staging Upstream Backend Integration (Apps Script)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Consumed by: src/lib/server/canonicalSubmissionAdapter.ts
# Format: https://script.google.com/macros/s/{STAGING_DEPLOYMENT_ID}/exec
# Guard: In staging, the deployment ID CANNOT match any operational deployment ID:
#   - AKfycbzQ719Bfg_qjQjJ1tHn8lK6wK4g4rW9XvV2m3yQ (PROD PRIMARY - REJECTED IN STAGING)
#   - AKfycbwYy... (PROD LEGACY - REJECTED IN STAGING)
APPS_SCRIPT_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbx_STAGING_MOCK_DEPLOYMENT_ID_PLACEHOLDER/exec

# Consumed by: src/lib/server/canonicalSubmissionAdapter.ts
# Description: Cryptographically random shared secret (>= 32 chars).
# Sent inside JSON body (payload.secret) to Apps Script doPost.
WEBHOOK_SECRET=staging_dummy_webhook_secret_min_32_characters_random_hex_0001

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Authentication & Session Security (Argon2id + HMAC)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Consumed by: src/lib/server/sessionService.ts
# Description: Server-only secret key used to sign and verify evaluation session JWTs.
# Format: Cryptographically random string >= 32 characters.
SESSION_SECRET=staging_dummy_session_signing_secret_min_32_chars_random_0001

# Consumed by: src/lib/server/sessionService.ts (account credential bootstrapping)
# Description: Initial bootstrap passwords for staging evaluation accounts.
# Complexity: Minimum 12 characters, uppercase, lowercase, number, symbol.
INITIAL_REV_MH_PWD=StagingRevMH2026!TestOnly
INITIAL_LEADERSHIP_PWD=StagingLead2026!TestOnly
INITIAL_ADMIN_PWD=StagingAdmin2026!TestOnly

# ==============================================================================
# COMPANION SCRIPT PROPERTIES FOR STAGING APPS SCRIPT
# ==============================================================================
# These properties must be set in Google Apps Script -> Project Settings -> Script Properties:
#
# Property Name            | Allowed Value / Pattern          | Purpose
# -------------------------|----------------------------------|------------------------------------
# APP_ENV                  | staging                          | Activates staging isolation guards
# TARGET_SPREADSHEET_ID    | {STAGING_SHEET_ID}               | Dedicated staging sheet (NOT prod)
# ROOT_DOCUMENTS_FOLDER_ID | {STAGING_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID}        | Dedicated staging Drive folder
# WEBHOOK_SECRET           | {MATCHING_WEBHOOK_SECRET}        | Must match Next.js WEBHOOK_SECRET
# ==============================================================================
